            "title": "Freedom in the World"
        },
        "abstract": "Freedom in the World, produced by Freedom House, is an annual report assessing political rights and civil liberties in 195 countries and 13 territories. It uses numerical ratings and descriptive texts to evaluate real-world rights and freedoms, emphasizing implementation over legal guarantees. The methodology is based on the Universal Declaration of Human Rights, applying universal standards regardless of geography, ethnicity, or level of economic development. ",
